   "bg": "yard",
   "pause_cap": 0.6
  },
  {
   "id": "e13",
   "who": "ASH",
   "text": "Fourteen's wide open. There's frost on the floor, Mick. In November. It's not a fridge.",
   "tag": "[uneasy]",
   "bg": "trailer"
  },
  {
   "id": "e14",
   "who": "ASH",
   "text": "There's writing in it. Like someone's done it with a finger. Lee. Lee. Lee. Over and over.",
   "tag": "[unnerved, quietly]",
   "bg": "trailer",
   "pause_cap": 0.5
  },
  {
   "id": "e15",
   "who": "ASH",
   "text": "And there's another one. Under the rest. Fresh. Three letters.",
